    {
      "source": "Simple default implementation of the <a href=\"BeanWiringInfoResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.wiring\"><code>BeanWiringInfoResolver</code></a> interface,\nlooking for a bean with the same name as the fully-qualified class name.\nThis matches the default name of the bean in a Spring XML file if the\nbean tag's \"id\" attribute is not used.",
      "translation": "`BeanWiringInfoResolver` 接口的简单默认实现，用于查找与完全限定类名相同的 Bean。如果未使用 bean 标签的\"id\"属性，则匹配 Spring XML 文件中 Bean 的默认名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the BeanWiringInfo for the given bean instance.",
      "translation": "解析给定 Bean 实例的 BeanWiringInfo。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"BeanWiringInfoResolver.html#resolveWiringInfo(java.lang.Object)\">resolveWiringInfo</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"BeanWiringInfoResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.wiring\">BeanWiringInfoResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"BeanWiringInfoResolver.html#resolveWiringInfo(java.lang.Object)\">resolveWiringInfo</a></code>` 在接口 `<code><a href=\"BeanWiringInfoResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.wiring\">BeanWiringInfoResolver</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
